/media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/8070284026987af8b340057d08d980df?_a=AQAEuop","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-24T15:07:42.262Z"},{"id":"AsDdJTTTT","title":"Issue 245 - Flutter Tap Weekly Newsletter","url":"https://fluttertap.com/archive/issue-245-flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/issue-245---flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter-asddjtttt","summary":"Weekly Flutter newsletter featuring tutorials on hidden Flutter widgets that save development time, building MCP clients in Dart, and recreating Discord with Flutter and Serverpod. Includes videos on developer relations, Supabase authentication with GoRouter, and community Q&A sessions. Also highlights useful packages for storage, mathematical expressions, and Bluetooth connectivity.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a35bbd9aed01e1633f08b1b15c7b885e?_a=AQAEulh","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-09-18T13:35:28.280Z"},{"id":"2Bn4wZnS9","title":"Issue 244 - Flutter Tap Weekly Newsletter","url":"https://fluttertap.com/archive/issue-244-flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/issue-244---flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter-2bn4wzns9","summary":"Flutter 3.35 introduces stateful hot reload for web, experimental Widget Previews, and accessibility improvements. Dart 3.9 brings enhanced null safety, faster CLI, and new MCP Server for AI assistants. The newsletter covers tutorials on Dart FFI for native C integration, widget_driver for cleaner architecture, and practical Flutter code snippets. Featured packages include widgetbook for widget cataloging, tostore for advanced storage, and measure_size for widget sizing.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/d803accbdfffc8b883695cc6b7fa4c9a?_a=AQAEulh","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-08-27T14:06:20.368Z"},{"id":"QvqjBaTFr","title":"Issue 243 - Flutter Tap Weekly Newsletter","url":"https://fluttertap.com/archive/issue-242-flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter-copy/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/issue-243---flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter-qvqjbatfr","summary":"Weekly Flutter newsletter featuring AI integration with Firebase Studio, decimal precision handling in Dart, real-time app updates with Shorebird, and Firebase Cloud Functions. Includes tutorials on game development with Flame engine, cross-platform development guides, and new Flutter packages for animated icons, Markdown rendering, and enhanced SnackBar components.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/de34e247a36783aaa364353907e8beeb?_a=AQAEulh","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-08-06T14:21:15.092Z"},{"id":"QqWorSXie","title":"Issue 242 - Flutter Tap Weekly Newsletter","url":"https://fluttertap.com/archive/issue-242-flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/issue-242---flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter-qqworsxie","summary":"Weekly Flutter newsletter covering Google's plans to merge Chrome OS with Android, tutorials on shake-to-report features, in-app purchases with RevenueCat, Flutter Signals for reactive UI, and responsive design. Includes videos on AI-assisted development with Claude, liquid glass UI effects, error handling, and new packages for glass effects, Linux settings, and navigation routing.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/92ee9f9cfe2e0d50991b28f052ddf634?_a=AQAEulh","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-07-16T15:48:38.444Z"},{"id":"pvUdIukzp","title":"Issue 241 - Flutter Tap Weekly Newsletter","url":"https://fluttertap.com/archive/issue-241-flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/issue-241---flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter-pvudiukzp","summary":"Weekly Flutter newsletter covering iOS 26 compatibility challenges for Flutter developers, tutorials on localization without context and app size optimization, video content including code reviews and game development, plus new packages for location tracking, device mockups, and memory leak detection.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/b916982d8eb53d20ed8b812730062c86?_a=AQAEulh","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-06-18T14:43:06.082Z"},{"id":"bFx7JCB6f","title":"Issue 240 - Flutter Tap Weekly Newsletter","url":"https://fluttertap.com/archive/issue-240-flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/issue-240---flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter-bfx7jcb6f","summary":"Flutter remains the most popular multi-platform app framework with significant updates in version 3.32, including experimental web hot reload, native fidelity improvements, and AI integrations with Gemini. Dart 3.8 introduces formatter updates, null-aware collection elements, and enhanced cross-platform capabilities. The newsletter covers tutorials on building AI-powered apps, API security, and Flutter overlays, plus showcases useful packages for text animations and particle effects.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a00fbd7d45c3ecb89f7c874a3fe173fc?_a=AQAEulh","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-04T15:06:08.328Z"},{"id":"MO1FL6lA0","title":"Issue 239 - Flutter Tap Weekly Newsletter","url":"https://fluttertap.com/archive/issue-239-flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/issue-239---flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter-mo1fl6la0","summary":"Explore the latest Flutter community insights, tutorials, and videos to enhance your Flutter skills. This issue features a section discussing community experiences and tutorials on optimizing Flutter ListView and securing APIs. It also includes video content on app updates and changing app icons, as well as a review of Flutter packages.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/adcb416a80b7b44aa158a6d91a7c8b88?_a=AQAEuj9","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-05-14T13:42:28.126Z"},{"id":"wEr2yKz1e","title":"Issue 238 - Flutter Tap Weekly Newsletter","url":"https://fluttertap.com/archive/issue-238-flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/issue-238---flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter-wer2ykz1e","summary":"Discover how to create agentic Flutter apps using tools like Angular, Firebase, and Vertex AI. Google provides starter kits and learning paths for integrating AI capabilities with Flutter applications. Additional resources include tutorials on enforcing single-session logins, server-driven UI, and app analytics. Videos offer optimization tips and insights on how RenderObjectWidgets work in Flutter.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/8d845f9b26b03070a6b2fed64fb8c9a2?_a=AQAEuj9","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-05-07T14:20:51.303Z"},{"id":"O41gL8hWt","title":"Issue 237 - Flutter Tap Weekly Newsletter","url":"https://fluttertap.com/archive/issue-237-flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/issue-237---flutter-tap-weekly-newsletter-o41gl8hwt","summary":"This edition of the Flutter Tap Weekly Newsletter provides valuable insights on improving app development speed, efficient API structuring for Flutter apps, and applying Riverpod state management. It includes tutorials on using WebSockets in Flutter and building video streaming and editing apps. Additionally, it highlights useful Flutter packages for audio visualization, animations, and multi-dropdown lists.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3acee4a3cfcaa2173f755b88d59ef6da?_a=AQAEuj9","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-04-23T14:38:59.069Z"}],"similar_handles":["wasmweekly","anavid","eventstore","jetcdev","daily_js"],"opposite_handles":["tbpn","alexfinn","felixrieseberg","ryolu_","kloss_xyz"],"similar":[{"id":"wasmweekly",